            <title>0.6.15</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2026 22:47:38 -0400</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/templetongroup/Kiki/releases/tag/v0.6.15</link>
            <sparkle:version>48</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.6.15</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Kiki 0.6.15

- Replaces ambiguous Workbench “Start Dictation” actions with “Try Dictation.”
- Keeps Kiki visible and opens a focused practice field for every in-window dictation test.
- Reserves dictation into other apps for the global shortcut and explicit menu-bar command.
]]></description>
