        <item>
            <title>0.6.14</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2026 20:51:38 -0400</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/templetongroup/Kiki/releases/tag/v0.6.14</link>
            <sparkle:version>47</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.6.14</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Kiki 0.6.14

- Makes the first Home-screen dictation a guided practice that inserts into Kiki's practice field.
- Returns focus to the previously active app before normal Workbench dictation starts.
- Preserves the intended destination through microphone permission and recording startup.
- Explains in the listening window which shortcut stops and inserts the dictation.
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/templetongroup/Kiki/releases/download/v0.6.14/Kiki-0.6.14-macOS.zip" length="53751147" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="rvZ8OpKwKfn4uof86RjtVJmtBgqfXdRETq3D7Bcmu38YP6wtgHonmF7SzlVyiBtlJg6u6wfnaB3x+lvD+fzKDA=="/>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>0.6.13</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2026 15:46:17 -0400</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/templetongroup/Kiki/releases/tag/v0.6.13</link>
            <sparkle:version>46</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.6.13</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Kiki 0.6.13

- Adds real model-download progress to Kiki Checkup and the compact transcription window.
- Clearly distinguishes downloading a model from loading it for transcription.
- Keeps Parakeet multi-file progress continuous and reports Whisper downloads from transferred bytes.
- Makes Home and Checkup readiness reflect live microphone, accessibility, model, shortcut, and first-dictation state.
- Improves keyboard focus, readable secondary text, destructive-action confirmation, and action-row consistency across Kiki.
- Preserves the approved dark Studio Hardware layout while tightening responsive and accessibility behavior.
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/templetongroup/Kiki/releases/download/v0.6.13/Kiki-0.6.13-macOS.zip" length="53744068" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="j5qSjwXv6XHggfXhbYwuXyDWrappsQ2jMcTUg1rKOE4pvUYZcoBjulPye4CIEQWlxNW4MeT3QSOUXzdDtzhcAw=="/>
